  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"1132\">\n<li data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"1055\">\n<p data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"827\"><strong data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"826\">Heinz Bodies Present</strong>:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"1055\">\n<li data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"888\">\n<p data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"888\">Suggests <strong data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"864\">oxidative hemolysis</strong> or enzyme deficiencies.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"1055\">\n<p data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"917\">Seen in conditions like:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"1055\">\n<li data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"943\">\n<p data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"943\"><strong data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"943\">G6PD deficiency</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"981\">\n<p data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"981\"><strong data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"981\">Unstable hemoglobinopathies</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1055\">\n<p data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1055\"><strong data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1007\">Toxic exposures</strong> (e.g., naphthalene, certain drugs like dapsone)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1132\">\n<p data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1083\"><strong data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1082\">Heinz Bodies Absent</strong>:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1132\">\n<li data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1132\">\n<p data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1132\">Normal finding; no oxidative damage evident.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
